ted their rough locations to me. Let me mark the latest one out on your map.","nextNodeIds":[205130110]},{"nodeId":205130110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":3187828714,"text":"I can't deal with Anemo Slimes since they can fly, so I can only turn to you!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205130111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3295164074,"text":"This is quite like Mondstadt.","nextNodeIds":[205130112]},{"nodeId":205130112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2748815274,"text":"I wouldn't argue with you, but Windwheel Asters and Anemo Slimes aren't seen together often.","nextNodeIds":[205130113]},{"nodeId":205130113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":14338370,"text":"Fortunately, Jack has seen this happen a few times before, and he has related their rough locations to me. Let me mark the latest one out on your map.","nextNodeIds":[205130114]},{"nodeId":205130114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":596704490,"text":"I really can't fight Anemo Slimes, since they can fly, so I can only count on you!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":205130115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3998432322,"text":"I'll just catch an Anemo Slime for you.","nextNodeIds":[205130116]},{"nodeId":205130116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":2800135258,"text":"You just want to watch me embarrass myself, don't you?","nextNodeIds":[205130117]},{"nodeId":205130117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":3725563706,"text":"Nonetheless, Windwheel Asters and Anemo Slimes aren't seen together often.","nextNodeIds":[205130118]},{"nodeId":205130118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1408,"speakerName":"Anthony","textMapHash":576187938